# Repo-root .gitignore for the yellow-goal tree.
# The main project lives in goal-gen/ (which has its own .gitignore). These
# patterns catch per-developer agent/tooling state that may be generated at the
# REPO ROOT when a tool runs from yellow-goal/ rather than goal-gen/ — none of
# these are ever legitimately tracked. Patterns are intentionally specific so
# they never shadow tracked content like goal-gen/.claude/specs/.

# ruvector vector storage (per-developer)
.ruvector/
ruvector.db

# Local agent / tooling state (per-developer; not shared)
.claude/agent-memory/
.claude/composio-usage.json
.claude/*.local.md
mempalace.yaml
entities.json

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
